==German==

===Etymology===
Old High German {{term|ziohan}}, from Germanic *{{term||tiuxan-}}.  Cognate with Middle Dutch {{term|tien|tīen}}, Old English {{term|teon|tēon}}.

===Verb===
{{de-verb|ziehe|ziehst|zieht|zog|gezogen|zöge|ziehe|zieht|haben}}
'''ziehen'''

# to [[pull]] (e.g., a door)
# {{context|a weapon|lang=de}} to [[draw]]
# {{context|intransitive|3rd. person singular neuter|lang=de}} to [[be]] [[drafty]]

